34
00:04:01,300 --> 00:04:02,800
みんなぐるぐるまわって
Everyone, spin round and round!

35
00:04:02,800 --> 00:04:04,300
ぐるぐるそうやって
Spinning round and round, just like that,

36
00:04:04,300 --> 00:04:05,800
もっとぐるぐるまわって
Spin even more round and round,

37
00:04:05,800 --> 00:04:07,400
ぐるぐるまわって
Spinning round and round,

38
00:04:07,400 --> 00:04:09,500
ずっとぐるぐるまわるーな
Spinning round and round forever, spin, Luna!

39
00:04:11,800 --> 00:04:17,000
