The spinning Earth...

40
00:04:17,000 --> 00:04:22,000
回り始め幾億年
...began rotating billions of years ago.

41
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:27,500
いつまでもこのまま
Forever and ever, just like this,

42
00:04:27,500 --> 00:04:34,500
回るみんなに幸せを...
bringing happiness to everyone spinning...

43
00:04:34,600 --> 00:04:38,200
まわりつづくまわルーナ
Keep on spinning, spin, Luna!

44
00:04:38,500 --> 00:04:42,500
ますますます社会がぐるぐるま〜...
More and more, society spins round and r—...

45
00:04:42,600 --> 00:04:43,700
あれ？
Huh?

46
00:04:43,800 --> 00:04:45,300
ぐるぐるまわって
Spinning round and round,

47
00:04:45,300 --> 00:04:46,800
もっとぐるぐるまわって
Spin even more round and round,

48
00:04:46,800 --> 00:04:48,300
ぐるぐるまわって
Spinning round and round,

49
00:04:48,300 --> 00:04:49,800
みんなぐるぐるまわって
Everyone, spin round and round!

50
00:04:50,500 --> 00:04:52,000
ぐるぐる笑って
Laughing round and round,

51
00:04:52,000 --> 00:04:53,600
もっともっと
Even more, even more!

52
00:04:54,000 --> 00:04:55,600
ぐるぐる踊って
Dancing round and round,

53
00:04:55,600 --> 00:04:57,200
みんな踊って
Everyone, dance!

54
00:04:57,500 --> 00:04:59,200
ぐるぐる回って
Spinning round and round,

55
00:04:59,200 --> 00:05:00,500
もっと
Even more!

56
00:05:01,000 --> 00:05:03,000
ぐるぐる
Round and round...

57
00:05:03,388 --> 00:05:05,388
んな～
Nnaaa~

58
00:05:05,388 --> 00:05:07,888
ぐるぐるまわる＠まわルーナ
Spinning and turning, spinning Ruuna!

59
00:05:16,588 --> 00:05:18,388
いつもおとぎ話のお姫様
Always the princess of a fairy tale...

60
00:05:18,388 --> 00:05:20,388
みんなの輝くお月様
And everyone's shining moon...

61
00:05:20,388 --> 00:05:22,388
今日はおやすみして
But tonight, take a rest...

62
00:05:22,388 --> 00:05:24,888
重たい王冠今は置いといて
And put aside the heavy crown for now.

63
00:05:24,888 --> 00:05:28,888
どっちの私も好きになってくれますか
Will you love both versions of me?

64
00:05:28,888 --> 00:05:33,188
どっちも欲しいから まんなかにいたくなる
Since I want both, I want to stay right in the middle!

65
00:05:33,188 --> 00:05:37,388
スニーカーとシャツに着替えて
Changing into sneakers and a shirt,

66
00:05:37,388 --> 00:05:41,588
あるき出したんだ 出発のアラームは
