...I'll be right in the center of your heart!

83
00:06:36,588 --> 00:06:40,388
まんなかにかさなるちてん
The point overlapping right in the middle.

84
00:06:40,388 --> 00:06:44,388
まんなかでよくばるちてん
The point where I get greedy right in the middle.

85
00:06:44,388 --> 00:06:48,888
まんなかのまんなかちてん
The very center, the middle point.

86
00:06:48,888 --> 00:06:53,188
恋する女の子のいいとこ取りで
Taking the best parts of a girl in love,

87
00:06:53,188 --> 00:06:58,188
照れ隠しと素直の今 まんなかちてん
hiding my shyness and being honest, at the middle point.

88
00:06:59,888 --> 00:07:02,888
跪きなさい。
Kneel down.

89
00:07:02,888 --> 00:07:07,888
汝、この城の扉を叩いた者よ。
Ye who have knocked on the gates of this castle...

90
00:07:07,888 --> 00:07:09,888
