LuKnight Rule #2!

103
00:07:53,888 --> 00:07:56,388
シルクのお布団持ってきて！
Bring me a silk duvet!

104
00:07:56,388 --> 00:07:58,588
ルーナイト 第三条！
LuKnight Rule #3!

105
00:07:58,588 --> 00:08:00,388
三時のお茶会来れる人！
You must attend the 3 PM tea party!

106
00:08:00,388 --> 00:08:02,888
守れなかったら 即制裁！
Failure to comply means immediate punishment!

107
